<title>TURKEY: Turk shares ease 0.99 pct on high interest rates.</title>
<headline>Turk shares ease 0.99 pct on high interest rates.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish stocks eased on Friday morning amid rising interest rates and higher inflation expectations.</p>
<p>The IMKB National-100 eased 0.99 percent or 19 points to 1,906. Morning trade volume shrank by 34.5 percent to 8.98 trillion lira from Thursday's 13.7 trillion.</p>
</text>
